AegisWAF \endash  Setup Notes\par
\par
This installer deploys the AegisWAF Web Application Firewall administration console and its embedded gateway onto this computer.\par
\par
Prerequisite: a reachable PostgreSQL server (local or remote). Nothing else is required beforehand \endash  the application walks you through first-time configuration (database connection and the website to protect) the first time it starts.\par
\par
This build has no separate authentication step; access to the admin console is controlled at the network/host level. Deploy it only on machines and networks you are authorized to administer.\par
\par
Click Next to continue with installation.\par
